et, it may be unavailable for a few seconds, and some data may be cleared.",[217,218,220],"h2",{"id":219},"login","Login",[190,222,223],{},"Use the following credentials:",[225,226,232],"pre",{"className":227,"code":229,"language":230,"meta":231},[228],"language-text","Username: demo\nPassword: fivenet-demo\n","text","",[233,234,229],"code",{"__ignoreMap":231},[204,236,238],{"icon":237},"i-mdi-info-slab-circle",[190,239,240],{},"Not every feature is fully available in the demo environment. Some advanced functionality may be limited or simulated.",[217,242,244],{"id":243},"best-way-to-explore","Best Way to Explore",[190,246,247,248,251,252,255],{},"The demo account includes multiple characters. For the best overview, use the ",[212,249,250],{},"Los Santos Police Department (LSPD)"," character with the ",[233,253,254],{},"police"," job.",[190,257,258,259,262],{},"This character has access to ",[212,260,261],{},"superuser mode",", which lets you:",[264,265,266,270],"ul",{},[267,268,269],"li",{},"Switch between jobs",[267,271,272],{},"Explore administrative features",[190,274,275,276,279],{},"You can enable or disable superuser mode from the ",[212,277,278],{},"user menu"," in the left sidebar.",[204,281,284],{"icon":282,"color":283},"i-mdi-lightbulb-on-outline","info",[190,285,286],{},"If you want to explore as much of FiveNet as possible, start with the police character and enable superuser mode.",[217,288,290],{"id":289},"feedback","Feedback",[190,292,293],{},"If you run into problems or have suggestions, reach out to the FiveNet team on Discord.",{"title":231,"searchDepth":295,"depth":295,"links":296},2,[297,298,299],{"id":219,"depth":295,"text":220},{"id":243,"depth":295,"text":244},{"id":289,"depth":295,"text":290},"Try FiveNet using the public demo instance.","md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fdemo",{"title":15,"description":300},"1.getting-started\u002F2.demo","zmgFGSF0IMz-keHr9k8AtB3j52j6y5BtxHX8AKsWRoc",[310,315],{"title":311,"path":312,"stem":313,"